em_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/532ba61f2311a4cab6890f59d6aef86d.avif?t=1782883581\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras_big/532ba61f2311a4cab6890f59d6aef86d.webp?t=1782883581 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/947b523b9fc126122ac670e1fcbe4fb8.avif?t=1782883581\" width=1275 height=380 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/a5b6087877ca757b87154e542c6cefc8.poster.avif?t=1782883581\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/a5b6087877ca757b87154e542c6cefc8.webm?t=1782883581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/a5b6087877ca757b87154e542c6cefc8.mp4?t=1782883581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Experience three unique characters, each with their own style:</strong> <br>Akira – A genius hitman who masters gunfire and melee. <br>Yoko – Akira’s partner who uses mobile attacks to outsmart enemies. <br>Suzuki – A cold-blooded assassin who uses traps and bullets to defeat enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/532ba61f2311a4cab6890f59d6aef86d.avif?t=1782883581\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras_big/532ba61f2311a4cab6890f59d6aef86d.webp?t=1782883581 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/b2c30da45052a759d331834b86905266.avif?t=1782883581\" width=1280 height=380 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Damage during battles is represented as holes in the page.</strong>  <br>You cannot place panels in areas where there are holes.  <br>Carefully evaluate each situation and defeat all enemies within the turn limit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/532ba61f2311a4cab6890f59d6aef86d.avif?t=1782883581\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras_big/532ba61f2311a4cab6890f59d6aef86d.webp?t=1782883581 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/70d985c96bbac6c2f6e187fbdcb9682c.avif?t=1782883581\" width=1280 height=380 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/2e1d3d2b277c2c8cd335efb94b4ca436.poster.avif?t=1782883581\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/2e1d3d2b277c2c8cd335efb94b4ca436.webm?t=1782883581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/2e1d3d2b277c2c8cd335efb94b4ca436.mp4?t=1782883581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between tense battles, relax with surreal little mini-game events.  <br>Score high, and you’ll have a chance to earn powerful new panels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/532ba61f2311a4cab6890f59d6aef86d.avif?t=1782883581\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras_big/532ba61f2311a4cab6890f59d6aef86d.webp?t=1782883581 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/ea2875a642e6cedc18a28b5ea6289241.avif?t=1782883581\" width=1280 height=380 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For players who want to push their wit to the limit, there’s Puzzle Mode.  <br>Use the given panels to defeat all enemies within a single page.  <br>(Even the developers don’t know how much thought and time the hardest puzzles will take to solve. But don’t give up—there’s always a solution!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/532ba61f2311a4cab6890f59d6aef86d.avif?t=1782883581\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras_big/532ba61f2311a4cab6890f59d6aef86d.webp?t=1782883581 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/0c718e2ff4ee0af807db8936c8bdc131.avif?t=1782883581\" width=1280 height=380 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/a870e6a6e48ddc9fbc524563338a6254.poster.avif?t=1782883581\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/a870e6a6e48ddc9fbc524563338a6254.webm?t=1782883581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/a870e6a6e48ddc9fbc524563338a6254.mp4?t=1782883581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And of course, it wouldn’t be The Fable without him—Yuki, the playboy. At the bar, he challenges the beautiful Yoko to a drinking match. Can this reckless, foolish man impress the Drunk Queen Yoko, or will he just crash and burn?</p>",
